{"nodes":[{"id":"root","type":"text","x":0,"y":0,"width":520,"height":320,"color":"4","text":"# D｜121 Agency Control\nAI什么时候自主连续执行、什么时候找74、什么时候STOP。\n四因子：confidence / reversibility / preference-load / blast-radius"},{"id":"our","type":"text","x":620,"y":-200,"width":470,"height":330,"color":"4","text":"# OUR CENTER\nAUTO / REVIEW / STOP\nREVIEW_QUEUE\nAgency Packet\n规则设计完成；Implementation / Empirical Validation TODO\n当前实际掌握度：约42/100（待日志验证校准）"},{"id":"social","type":"text","x":-650,"y":-200,"width":470,"height":350,"color":"3","text":"# SOCIAL-D\n社会成熟度：约65/100\n成熟：HITL、approval gate、least privilege\n半成熟：dynamic autonomy、uncertainty escalation\n开放：创意/审美介入时机\n→ 详见 LEARNING_GAP.canvas"},{"id":"gap","type":"text","x":0,"y":460,"width":520,"height":290,"color":"2","text":"# OUR RESEARCH GAP\nPreference-load × Decision consequence\n什么时候真的值得打断74？\n怎样集中审核而不是逐步打断？\n\n贡献候选→详见 CONTRIBUTION.canvas"}],"edges":[{"id":"e1","fromNode":"root","toNode":"our","label":"OUR"},{"id":"e2","fromNode":"root","toNode":"social","label":"SOCIAL"},{"id":"e3","fromNode":"root","toNode":"gap","label":"RESEARCH"}]}